# Development Workflow Guide

## Project Structure
SysteMaster follows a multi-crate Rust workspace architecture:

- **Root Workspace**: [Cargo.toml](mdc:Cargo.toml) defines workspace members
- **API**: [api/](mdc:api) - Backend server and storage
- **CLI**: [cli/](mdc:cli) - Command-line interface
- **Frontend**: [frontend/](mdc:frontend) - Yew web application
- **Library**: [library/](mdc:library) - Shared systematic structures
- **Dev Runner**: [dev-runner/](mdc:dev-runner) - Development utilities

## Build and Run Commands

### All Components
```bash
cargo dev  # Coordinated startup via dev-runner
```

### Individual Components
```bash
# API Server
cd api && cargo run --bin server
cd api && cargo watch -x "run --bin server"  # Watch mode

# Frontend Development
cd frontend && trunk serve     # Development server
cd frontend && trunk build    # Production build

# CLI Usage
cd cli && cargo run -- [command]
cd cli && cargo install --path .  # Install locally

# Workspace Operations
cargo build --workspace
cargo test --workspace
cargo check --workspace
```

