## Code Style Guidelines
- Follow Rust conventions and idioms
- Use consistent error handling patterns
- Maintain comprehensive documentation for public APIs
- Include source attribution comments for systematic structures
- Separate concerns between API logic and positioning logic
- Use meaningful method names that distinguish user vs canonical data
